class Solution {
    public boolean isSubsequence(String s, String t) {
        // Two pointers: one for s, one for t
        int i=0;
        int j=0;
        while(i<s.length() && j<t.length()){
            if(s.charAt(i)==t.charAt(j)){
                i++; // If characters match, move both pointers
                j++;
            }else{ 
                j++; // If not, only move pointer for t
            }
        }
        // If we have matched all characters of s, it's a subsequence
        return i==s.length(); 
    }
}


Time Complexity: O(n) or O(|t|) (we scan through t once).
Space Complexity: O(1) (just two pointers).
